    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20462" root="سلع" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْقُورٌ مُسَلَّعَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A number of</i> [<i>wild</i>] <i>bulls</i> or <i>cows
having some firewood of the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلَع</span> <i>hung to their
tails,</i> [<i>with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُشَر</span>, <i>and then set on fire,</i>] (S, * TA,)
or <i>having their backs laden therewith.</i> (TA.)
[See 2, and see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلَعٌ</span>.]

